+
+Every command's own exit code, captured with `rc=$?` on the immediately following line. The table
+below is the **fix-4** re-run (after the codex §9 round-4 `[P2]` + `[P3]` and the sweep of §13);
+every rc is unchanged from the round-0 close, fix-1, fix-2 and fix-3. **Gate 6's count did not move
+at fix-4** — it stayed **23**, because every fix-4 change strengthened an existing criterion rather
+than minting one. The last count move was fix-3's 22 → **23** (§12).
+
+| # | Command | rc | Note |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| 1 | `bash scripts/check-governed-surface-pin.sh` | `0` | pin intact (30 allowlist / 5 core / 5 recovery_denylist) |
+| 2 | `git rev-parse HEAD:src/conformance/governed-surface-allowlist.json` | `0` | prints `93ef3a8616e460c443417cdffc1e9f711ceb12f8` |
+| 3 | `bash scripts/lint-design-status.sh` | `0` | this doc carries `status: ACTIVE` |
+| 4 | `bash scripts/agent-lint-md.sh` | `0` | markdownlint + plans/design status + findings + anchors + release-state views |
+| 5 | `bash scripts/lint-findings.sh` | `0` | register untouched — 39 ids, all unique |
+| 6 | `python3 -m pytest scripts/sbom-survey/tests --tb=no -q -rsE` | `1` | `collected 23 items` → **`23 failed`** — 0 passed, 0 skipped, 0 errors |
+| 7 | `git diff --name-only cbb56212` | `0` | no manifest, no lockfile, nothing under `src/`, `engine/`, `.github/` |
